<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pharmaceutical Product.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pharmaceutical Product.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of Pharmaceutical Product Development Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Projects 25 percent annual revenue growth and 32 percent annual earnings per share growth.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price per share target in high-20's.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 23.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
